<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-26754] Changes in ClusterNode serialization broke binary compatibility</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-26754</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-26211&quot; title=&quot;New node property to distinguish different DCs&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-26211&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-26211&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; merged it turned out that code in master became incompatible and is unable to read some metastorage keys written by older versions.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Changes in TcpDiscoveryNode and ZookeeperClusterNode serialization are needed to overcome this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
